  Licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License,
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
  passalong draws the six words of a store's passphrase from this list.

rustls-platform-verifier, Android component
  The app includes the Kotlin component of the rustls-platform-verifier
  crate (org.rustls:rustls-platform-verifier), which the Rust core uses to
  verify TLS certificates through Android's trust store.
